    "voice": "produce_events/300302404/3003024040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003024040030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "その後、ミニライブのこととか話してたんだけど\r\nわたし、寝落ちしちゃってて……えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300302404/3003024040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003024040040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ミニライブのコンセプト案がまとまったから、\r\n安心しちゃったのかも",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300302404/3003024040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごく悩ませちゃったみたいで、悪かったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003024040050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ええ！？　なんで！？\r\nわたしはやれてよかったよー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300302404/3003024040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003024040060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしたちのライブのことだもん\r\nプロデューサー全然悪くない！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300302404/3003024040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、ならよかった\r\nそれに、送ってもらったコンセプトすごくいいと思ったぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003024040070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんとっ？　やったー！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
